#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:32
#: cc3f634a2e8b4ad593368cce6af695b6
msgid "Pinout/Wiring Diagram"
msgstr "引脚定义/接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:38
#: 79b0e5833ee74214a1c5801166d419b1
msgid "UART Mapping"
msgstr "UART 映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:40
#: d612a56fd983443ebcef632e19cc3aac
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked RXn and TXn in the above pinouts. The RXn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The TXn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚定义中，UART 标注为 RXn 和 TXn。RXn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，TXn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:43
#: e5f3e11230ae493b90bef8ddc9a15866
msgid ""
"In addition to pads, the board also has SH6P 1mm connector for DJI FPV and "
"SH8P 1mm connector for 4 in 1 ESC."
msgstr "除焊盘外，该板还有用于 DJI FPV 的 SH6P 1mm 接口和用于 4合1 ESC 的 SH8P 1mm 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:46
#: 5e429ee5a0f741aa80607e536ca759a7
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:47
#: d44e019e36d94328b5ed8ea8141eb9cf
msgid "SERIAL1 -> USART1 (MAVLink2,DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> USART1（MAVLink2，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:48
#: f69e1f997ba8427a94b9ca77645790ef
msgid "SERIAL2 -> USART2 (RCIN, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> USART2（RCIN，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:49
#: f31dfca8e50c4f0eae3456d3f16f5147
msgid "SERIAL3 -> USART3 (User,DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> USART3（用户，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:50
#: 0e2ee86454564af591fde9daf51537db
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:51
#: f73e0219e68a4b14b3040ee19adcb340
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART5 (Solder pads labeled R5 T5)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（焊盘标注 R5 T5）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:52
#: 91c2bccdc5cb439b97aa8ee29e87f0d6
msgid "SERIAL6 -> USART6 (DisplayPort, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> USART6（DisplayPort，已启用 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:53
#: 46d48ca9cef144f0a419326828833252
msgid "SERIAL7 -> UART7 (RX pin only, ESC Telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（仅 RX 引脚，ESC 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:54
#: f29e693758314dd2b0193ed3356a53ec
msgid ""
"SERIAL8 -> UART8 (Unused, not tested, no pinout, need to solder direct on "
"processor pins to utilize if you need just one more UART)"
msgstr "SERIAL8 -> UART8（未使用，未测试，无引脚定义，若需要额外 UART 需直接焊接到处理器引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:59
#: ff02c016d07f47c196b2101b3509be68
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:61
#: 644540efe0004e4183cb4b28e7ca6da3
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX2/TX2 (USART2_RX/USART2_TX) pins. It "
"supports ELRS(CSRF), TBS(CSRF), SBUS, IBUS, DSM2, and DSMX."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 RX2/TX2（USART2_RX/USART2_TX）引脚上，支持 "
"ELRS(CRSF)、TBS(CRSF)、SBUS、IBUS、DSM2 和 DSMX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:64
#: e8beeaf4ed674f32ad8c46feb83b8000
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:66
#: 8f42dea1b6ff4a978396c3eb454d7379
msgid ""
"JHEMCU H743 supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). HD goggle OSD is"
" pre-configured on UART6 on the HD goggle connector. Change OSD_TYPE to "
"\"5\" to use HD systems. This also enables the internal analog OSD system "
"which can be used simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"JHEMCU H743 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。高清护目镜 OSD 预配置在 HD 护目镜接口的 UART6 "
"上。将 OSD_TYPE 改为「5」即可使用高清系统，同时也会启用内置模拟 OSD 系统，两者可同时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:69
#: a4d8fa8cadbd49ee8a28521b89702cb1
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:71
#: 468cbdc0006b4867bf7674497a41d708
msgid ""
"JHEMCU H743 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. 8 motors and 1 LED strip or 9th "
"PWM output. PWM and DShot is supported on all outputs. Outputs 1-8 support "
"bi-directional Dshot also."
msgstr ""
"JHEMCU H743 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出：8 路电机和 1 路 LED 灯带或第 9 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持 PWM 和 "
"DShot。输出 1-8 还支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:74
#: 081575422232479189aa1fd691bdab0b
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:77
#: 1fab1fd95e544043b44626a4eeb9c8fd
msgid "PWM 1 - 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1 - 4 在组1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:78
#: 5dddcf7bb58e4ba4b571b8954bc1e2ce
msgid "PWM 5, 6  in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在组2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:79
#: ee90c04d041e4b6bbf47729878827490
msgid "PWM 7, 8  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 在组3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:80
#: 99071b6c6d4748b6b32d9671c0c79a16
msgid "PWM 9     in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在组4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:82
#: 918d23aa393d4faea181a6920f6f4c56
msgid ""
"Outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"output in a group uses DShot then all in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的输出需使用相同的输出频率。若某组中任意输出使用 DShot，则该组所有输出均需使用 DShot。"

