#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:98
#: 68e0178f48d640ad9831011fc479de0f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:100
#: 48f428bafe9f4431bf91a3a40e462464
msgid ""
"JHEMCU H743 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an external"
" compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "JHEMCU H743 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:103
#: db5353d67ab94b94b3a58b0822b8ef38
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:105
#: 875428188e89415c9aa6ce5a4d6f60a7
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"JHEMCU-H743HD\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有「JHEMCU-H743HD」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:108
#: f0f67cb0f2d24be7a8608f72b61d7498
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:110
#: 31c1362f1d044f1ba83548b25a91c532
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcu-h743hd.rst:114
#: 934572e1c3924acb9506bd760e77a4bb
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
